{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"After returning from this excursion, Cousin gave me your kind letter, in which you write to me about my ill health and your worries about it. Immanuel writes, what caused me to become unwell? — he must know that I am no longer such a small springing-about fellow as he, but already an old father, — that I wish for advanced age and health, especially in order to see him and his brother continue to flourish, and to be able to contribute my part to it, — and to be able to share with you, my dear, for a long time yet, this satisfaction which is to be hoped for and which was brought into fresher remembrance on his birthday..."}}],"created":1795219280,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":142,"prompt_tokens":210,"total_tokens":352,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-08BNh5WSo9WDeOTmDue2S9IsRWo1mqBK","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":210,"prompt_ms":375.578,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.7884666666666666,"prompt_per_second":559.1381816826332,"predicted_n":142,"predicted_ms":3322.511,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.563907801418438,"predicted_per_second":42.437782749252}}